**1. Pehle samjho hum bana kya rahe hain**

Hum ek simple Python website banayenge.

```text
Python website
      ↓
Local testing
      ↓
Docker image banana
      ↓
Code GitHub par upload karna
      ↓
GitHub Actions automatically tests run karega
      ↓
Tests pass hone par image Docker Hub par upload hogi
      ↓
Kubernetes us image se application ki 2 copies chalayega
      ↓
Application update karke Version 2 deploy karenge
